# PuckNetwork — ESP-NOW Communication Layer
# Files: src/coordinator/PuckNetwork.h, PuckNetwork.cpp

## PURPOSE
Manages all ESP-NOW communication with pucks: pairing, commands, events, OTA updates.

## INITIALIZATION (begin())
1. Load SSID/password from NVS Preferences
2. WiFi mode WIFI_AP_STA, disable power-save (esp_wifi_set_ps(WIFI_PS_NONE))
3. SoftAP on WIFI_CHANNEL (1), max MAX_PEERS (20) connections
4. esp_now_init(), register OnDataRecv + OnDataSent callbacks
5. Add broadcast peer on WIFI_IF_STA
6. Send 3x CMD_PING broadcast for re-pairing existing pucks

## PUCK REGISTRATION (in update())
- OnDataRecv ISR enqueues events into circular eventQueue[100]
- update() dequeues and processes:
  - Unknown MAC → find empty slot in pucks[MAX_PEERS], esp_now_add_peer()
  - EVT_HELLO → send CMD_PAIR_ACK
  - Restore cached last effect on reconnect
  - Apply brightness limit on reconnect
- Deduplication via seqNr (EventPacket.seqNr vs puck.lastSeqNr)

## COMMAND SENDING
- sendToPuck(mac, cmd): Unicast, 3 retries with 5-8ms delays, waits 15ms for ACK
- broadcast(cmd): 3x with 10ms delays
- Both assign globalCmdSeq sequence number
- CMD_EFFECT cached in puck.lastEffect for reconnect restore
- Quiet mode filter: blocks CMD_SOUND/CMD_SEQUENCE, delays replacement beep

## KEEPALIVE
- Every 10s: broadcast CMD_KEEPALIVE
- Pucks timeout after 15s without keepalive → auto-disconnect

## OTA UPDATE
- triggerUpdateBroadcast(): Legacy, 5x broadcast UpdateCredentialsPacket
- triggerUpdateSequential(): New preferred method
  - State machine: OTA_TRIGGERING → OTA_DONE
  - 25s timeout per puck, sequential unicast
  - getOtaStatusJSON() for progress polling

## MODES
- RSSI Mode: Every 2s maps RSSI (-95 to -55) → EFF_PROGRESS with color
- Quiet Mode: filterSoundForQuietMode() blocks sounds, delays ski/race beeps
- Brightness Limit: CMD_SET_BRIGHTNESS broadcast, 10-100% range

## STATISTICS (NetworkStats)
totalPacketsRx, duplicates, validEvents, queueOverflows, successfulTx, failedTx
Auto-save via StatsManager::saveAll() every 10 minutes.

## KEY STRUCTURES
- PuckInfo: mac, active, rssi, battery, version, temp_c10, lastSeen, lastClickTime, totalClicks, totalMinutes, lastEffect cache
- QueueItem: mac[6] + EventPacket + valid flag
- OtaStatus: state, currentPuckIdx, pucksTriggered, totalPucks, triggerTime
